add("HIS-10-04-11",ch10_04,"What was the mandate system created after World War I?",["A system of direct colonial administration","A system where former Ottoman and German colonies were administered by Allied powers under League of Nations supervision","A democratic voting system","A military alliance system"],"b","The mandate system placed former German and Ottoman territories under Allied administration with the stated goal of preparing them for self-governance.","Medium")
