add("HIS-10-04-13",ch10_04,"The Holocaust refers to:",["The bombing of Hiroshima","The systematic genocide of six million Jews and millions of others by Nazi Germany","The Armenian Genocide","The Rwandan Genocide"],"b","The Holocaust was the systematic, state-sponsored murder of approximately six million Jews and millions of others by Nazi Germany during WWII.","Medium")
add("HIS-10-04-14",ch10_04,"What was the New Deal in the United States?",["A military buildup program","President Roosevelts program of economic recovery and reform during the Great Depression","A trade agreement with Japan","A peace treaty with Germany"],"b","The New Deal was a series of programs by President Roosevelt to combat the Great Depression through economic recovery, relief, and reform.","Medium")
