add("HIS-10-04-20",ch10_04,"What was the Atlantic Charter (1941)?",["A military alliance between Germany and Japan","A joint declaration by the US and UK outlining post-war goals including self-determination and free trade","A peace treaty ending World War I","A trade agreement with African nations"],"b","The Atlantic Charter (August 1941) was a joint declaration by Roosevelt and Churchill outlining post-war goals including self-determination and international cooperation.","Medium")
add("HIS-10-04-21",ch10_04,"How did World War II accelerate decolonization in Africa and Asia?",["It had no effect on colonialism","It weakened European powers, empowered independence movements, and exposed the contradiction of fighting for freedom abroad while denying it in colonies","It strengthened colonial rule","It led to new colonial territories"],"b","WWII weakened European colonial powers economically and militarily, while colonial subjects who fought for freedom abroad demanded the same rights at home.","Hard")
add("HIS-10-04-22",ch10_04,"What was the significance of Haile Selassies 1936 declaration from Harar?",["It was a peace treaty with Italy","It reaffirmed Ethiopias sovereignty and rejected Italian claims of colonial domination","It was an alliance with Britain","It declared war on the United States"],"b","From Harar during the Italian occupation, Haile Selassie made declarations reaffirming Ethiopian sovereignty and rallying resistance against Italian rule.","Hard")
