add("HIS-10-04-24",ch10_04,"How did the Great Depression impact colonial Africa?",["It improved conditions for all Africans","It caused economic hardship, reduced export prices, and increased exploitation of African labor","It had no impact on Africa","It led to immediate independence for African colonies"],"b","The Great Depression reduced global demand for African raw materials, causing economic hardship, while colonial governments increased taxes and forced labor.","Hard")
